  patched file keeps the licence and Intel copyright notice of the upstream
  kernel source, which is fetched on the managed host and is not part of this
  collection; the built module is covered by the kernel's GPL-2.0 terms.

StreamStack (roles/developer_workstation/files/streamstack/)
  Vendored subtree of the StreamStack project, version 0.0.26, licensed under
  the Apache License 2.0 (its own LICENSE file). It bundles no third-party code.

The chat profile is optional and off by default. Material that the roles
download on the managed host (wee-slack, go.py, DeepFilterNet, OpenVINO, the
YuNet model, tmux, HashiCorp tools and other vendor releases) is not
redistributed here; it keeps its upstream licences.

Files whose provenance is unresolved are left out of the built collection
(galaxy.yml build_ignore) and listed in THIRD_PARTY_INVENTORY.yml with status
"excluded". Run `make licenses` after building to check the artifact.
